.TH VIBEOS-WEATHER 1 "2026-11-16" "vibeos 0.1.0" "VibeOS"
.SH NAME
vibeos-weather \- weather app for VibeOS
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B vibeos-weather
.SH DESCRIPTION
Shows the weather where the phone is: now, the next 24 hours, today against yesterday, the week and the details.
The place is the first city in GNOME Weather if it has one, otherwise where GeoClue puts the phone (city accuracy),
named by OpenStreetMap's Nominatim. The forecast is Open-Meteo's (no key). The last place and forecast are kept in
.I ~/.cache/vibeos-launcher/
so the app opens on them at once.
.SH SEE ALSO
geoclue(5)
